==Battleground==
*3 [[Znache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Loris]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bun Bun Black]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~23.33 seconds<sup>400f~700f</sup>.
**6 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Othom]] spawns.
**1 [[Cadaver Bear]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use the startoff to build up your wallet.

On base hit, you're greeted by four threats: Bun Bun Black, Cadaver Bear, Othom, and Shadow Boxer K spam. Use your Holy Blast when Cadaver Bear burrows, then use [[Awakened Mina]] and [[Storm Beast Naala]] to snipe him to death. Use [[Cat Mask Doron]] to Freeze Othom, then get in large amounts of chip damage to Bun Bun Black with units like [[Fishman Cat]], Talented [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and [[Pizza Cat]].

